<title>USA: Belmont Homes Q1 sales up, net, shr down.</title>
<headline>Belmont Homes Q1 sales up, net, shr down.</headline>
<dateline>BELMONT, Miss. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							 Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								 March 31,</p>
<p>							     1997	1996</p>
<p> Net sales					   $ 52,144   $51,445</p>
